          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho leba Omukushi agoba, agamba ati, “Nyina amakuru garungi, Rugaba Mukama wange, kuba kir'eki Omukama yakweholera, yakwihya omu mikono ya bona abakushengire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Daudi abaza Omukushi ogwo ati, “Omwana wange Abusalomu aliho buhore?” Omukushi amuhorora ati, “Ababisha bawe, Rugaba Mukama wange, na bona abakushenga abenda kukukora kubi babe nk'omusigazi ogwo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Omukama agwa omu kamazi, atemba omu kiyumba eiguru y'ekihigi, alira. Kayabaire nagenda achura ati, “Yo, mwana wange Abusalomu, mwana wange, mwana wange Abusalomu! Nimbe n'inye naba nfire iwe okakira. Yoo, Abusalomu mwana wange, mwana wange.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.33"
            ]
          }
        }
